From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] blueline: frame fingerprints for finding blinks without a camera

bluetouchscript step print,N: the next N frames shown are logged as a
6 x 12 grid of mean greens ("SWEET FP:" lines), so that tools/fpblink.py
can find a frame that steps back to an older picture.
